# Build output. Generated from the sources in sources.json by build.mjs, and
# built fresh by CI on every push to main (.github/workflows/deploy.yml), which
# then uploads it to the site. Deliberately NOT tracked: when it was, CI pushed
# a "Build: recompile dist/" commit after every push, which landed on top of
# whatever you were doing and turned the next push into a merge.
#
# Run ./build.sh after editing anything under libControl/ to refresh your local
# copy — a fresh clone has no dist/ until you do.
dist/
